# Timeline: Migrations

Spec: MigrationsIndex
Purpose:
  Entry point for migration records tracking transitions between
  architecture versions, decision versions, and skill versions.

Owns: timeline/migrations/

Structure:
  Migration records are .sdd files with @migration.M-XX IDs.
  States: PLANNED, IN_PROGRESS, PARTIAL, COMPLETED, FAILED, ROLLED_BACK

Rules:
  [MIG-01] Migrations MUST define rollback strategy before execution.
  [MIG-02] Partial migration state is recorded for accuracy.
  [MIG-03] Migrations are crash-safe — re-running is safe.

Navigation:
  Parent: @../INDEX.sdd
  MigrationRecords: @../migrations.sdd
  Changes: @../changes\INDEX.sdd
  Snapshots: @../snapshots\INDEX.sdd
  Evolution: @../evolution.sdd

State: +
